        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-486 (ensure controlled execution — Tax Credit Recovery, Registry Reporting &amp; Audit Defense (PA-85.3).) | - operational: ERP-aggregated computation
Owner: Tax Accountant</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
