    <bpmn:process id="W_W2914" name="W2914. SC/PWD Book-of-Sales Quarterly Compilation &amp; Submission (RR 7-2010)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Quarterly close
Frequency: Quarterly per location/entity
Volume: ~205 locations
Owner: Tax Manager
Participants: Tax Manager, Tax Accountant, Store Manager
Source: workflow W2914 — SC/PWD Book-of-Sales Quarterly Compilation &amp; Submission (RR 7-2010)</bpmn:documentation>
